{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-19","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：比例与整数","englishTitle":"Given three numbers, to investigate when it is possible to find a fourth proportional to them.","book":9,"number":19,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.19","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.19/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":19,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","contentId":"euclid-9-19","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f909d88c78e84d0c01d74490c65f0ccf063952e894bc9548b4ea38ff20c78ef2","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-19.statement","euclid-9-19.construction.1","euclid-9-19.proof.1","euclid-9-19.proof.2","euclid-9-19.proof.3","euclid-9-19.proof.4","euclid-9-19.proof.5","euclid-9-19.proof.6","euclid-9-19.proof.7","euclid-9-19.proof.8","euclid-9-19.proof.9","euclid-9-19.proof.10","euclid-9-19.proof.11","euclid-9-19.construction.2","euclid-9-19.proof.12","euclid-9-19.proof.13","euclid-9-19.proof.14","euclid-9-19.proof.15","euclid-9-19.proof.16","euclid-9-19.proof.17","euclid-9-19.proof.18","euclid-9-19.proof.19","euclid-9-19.proof.20","euclid-9-19.proof.21","euclid-9-19.conclusion","euclid-9-19.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-19.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5ccb1bd817e1df385bafb3b499d1ba9217bde12df5b94ba6512a119c1cbd09f2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Given three numbers, to investigate when it is possible to find a fourth proportional to them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"给三个号码,在它们找到第四比例项的时候进行调查。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1b5fd858bca4ffb02a8c12ca7ee6bb0c692665f82cbc849ce5f5a8d934cc230d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B, C be the given three numbers, and let it be required to investigate when it is possible to find a fourth proportional to them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B,C成为这三个数字,并让调查在可能找到一个第四比例项数字时进行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5b5503fb33f52340e7817c934d513ae183af3459dc4308b5a1ea0f80f13b4ec7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now either they are not in continued proportion, and the extremes of them are prime to one another; or they are in continued proportion, and the extremes of them are not prime to one another; or they are not in continued proportion, nor are the extremes of them prime to one another; or they are in continued proportion, and the extremes of them are prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,它们不是在连比例中,最穷者是互素;最穷者是连比例;最穷者不是互素;最穷者不是连比例,最穷者不是互素;最穷者是连比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e0e928d5ce6e7406b3e73b59123d9d227e6ac4750598bb2aaa80996e49232b32","citations":["euclid-9-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If then A, B, C are in continued proportion, and the extremes of them A, C are prime to one another, it has been proved that it is impossible to find a fourth proportional number to them. [[IX. 17](/principles/euclid-9-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果A,B,C在连比例,其中最极端的是A,C在互素,那么,事实证明,它们不可能找到第四比例项个数字。 [[IX. 17](/principles/euclid-9-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0a2eeac8b50ed402f3238f15aec914f50e294ab6a352a60b571440c7479038b7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"†Next, let A, B, C not be in continued proportion, the extremes being again prime to one another; I say that in this case also it is impossible to find a fourth proportional to them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,让我们A,B,C不要在连比例, 极端情况又在互素;我说,在这种情况下,它们也不可能找到第四比例项。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a3ea86f2c5ffa4a4c89ca00564bc114765ea224ac659a6441c2cf9fe96fbfab9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let D have been found, so that, as A is to B, so is C to D, and let it be contrived that, as B is to C, so is D to E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能的话,就D,A对B的比例等于C对D,而假设B对C对E的比例等于D；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比；B 与 C 之比等于 D 与 E 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f55a8ad31fc5e2ad0e1a019e4b7bffa59086d7bcdc172c28e08681b2a733a01d","citations":["euclid-7-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since, as A is to B, so is C to D, and, as B is to C, so is D to E, therefore, ex aequali, as A is to C, so is C to E. [[VII. 14](/principles/euclid-7-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,A比B等于C比D,B比C,C比E,因此,在平等的基础上,A比C等于E；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比；B 与 C 之比等于 D 与 E 之比；A 与 C 之比等于 C 与 E 之比。 [[VII. 14](/principles/euclid-7-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c7a9a01b492ee23ae127d58e66e4f8f251c6da9440a45a8065eaaeb11c58bd40","citations":["euclid-7-21","euclid-7-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But A, C are prime, primes are also least, [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] and the least numbers measure those which have the same ratio, the antecedent the antecedent and the consequent the consequent. [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A,C是质数,质数也是最少的, 最少的整除个是相同比例的, 之前的先数, 以及随之而来的结果。 [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"465166864360da7374272db0fd3cce0a916bb21e70ea0edce53bd06ab95d1028","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A measures C as antecedent antecedent."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A 整除 C是前身。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cac192440c9b4795a67b1db32631f7ffa6ecc81f69948b9fdee289009342448b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it also measures itself; therefore A measures A, C which are prime to one another: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它本身也整除;因此,A 整除 A,C,互素:这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a95a65ed8e5523e1b3259ed686d7913ef1873892aecedf4d4b8c1f6b7448cbef","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore it is not possible to find a fourth proportional to A, B, C.†"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,无法找到第四比例项至A、B、C."}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ab6e58a54b8b8c3844836e7d0a3f1464049720c25116bddf5eea7550f28622b3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let A, B, C be again in continued proportion, but let A, C not be prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,A,B,C再排连比例,但A,C不要排互素。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ae61c2f374aaf28e0b099b546e31b3402778c5282a8022d5d379e0cb97f445bd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that it is possible to find a fourth proportional to them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,它们有可能找到第四比例项。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":13,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"09a8abfb30f407bfc1c1bebb6caf5bd87a4df4c6a8d40b59188092ae3ec3b227","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let B by multiplying C make D; therefore A either measures D or does not measure it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"B和C的产物为D;因此,A或整除 D或整除不是A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2d190f5d7e87195038db003e78a88e81b30b842d87e0f5d4193af97c304baae1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First, let it measure it according to E; therefore A by multiplying E has made D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,根据E的计算,它为整除,因此,A乘以E, 已经达到D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5e79ed81c52933f644a8f74943fb02c6935b82535c76b74271722490f40bf807","citations":["euclid-7-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, further, B has also by multiplying C made D; therefore the product of A, E is equal to the product of B, C; therefore, proportionally, as A is to B, so is C to E; [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)] therefore E has been found a fourth proportional to A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,B乘以C乘以D;因此,A,E的产品等于B,C;因此,A与B的比例等于C与E的比例;因此,E被发现为第四比例项与A,B,C；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 E 之比。 [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"08a944f29409ddccb6067dc83af55550ef2f5ce709bda089e6488034e46e82f3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let A not measure D; I say that it is impossible to find a fourth proportional number to A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,让我们来讨论A而不是整除 D;我说,不可能找到一个第四比例项到A,B,C的数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"31038469848a5461aeec72cfdfb59c0757fdf5ccc4f4b69c2169f603ec594da3","citations":["euclid-7-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let E have been found; therefore the product of A, E is equal to the product of B, C. [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能,则查获E;因此,A,E的产值等于B,C的产值。 [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"102e6ff5f4fd1c27b1ea7e59c337286c6abc517bd7ffc3c8a15f727605dec378","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the product of B, C is D; therefore the product of A, E is also equal to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但B,C的产值是D,A,E的产值也等于D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"09b1fe5281c0bf78151ba44a9939ab1bc621f87807f49f5fcfa182ee8269f49d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A by multiplying E has made D; therefore A measures D according to E, so that A measures D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A乘以E, 使D;因此,根据E, A 整除 D, A 整除 D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d1ec4f415d3e86cbbf6b39c57106457286dcab8e5ef345d19fd75f02b4a2187f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it also does not measure it: which is absurd."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也并非整除它:这是荒谬的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b799ae8f26e5bdda198af67e96840bc098fce5328841eadca00cfaa65c039ef3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore it is not possible to find a fourth proportional number to A, B, C when A does not measure D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在A不是整除 D的情况下,不可能找到第四比例项至A、B、C的号码。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3514ceefdb091146d95c1e64154e56143e8358f3eee4d6f7922f802df758e733","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let A, B, C not be in continued proportion, nor the extremes prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,A,B,C 不应该在连比例, 也不应该在互素"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1311b4ee24f04f301609568ae36e633970ef29b5b85cb7817e0161d060ebccba","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And let B by multiplying C make D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"B和C的产物 D"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":24,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e54002b95cf4654a69413a4152bcef625d3b585552a25831c0af7eb05cf21922","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly then it can be proved that, if A measures D, it is possible to find a fourth proportional to them, but, if it does not measure it, impossible. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,也可以证明,如果A 整除 D, 有可能找到第四比例项, 但是,如果它不是整除, 则不可能找到。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-19.source","contentId":"euclid-9-19","revisionId":"euclid-9-19@raw-f909d88c78e84d0c","order":25,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2e42721fd7b5e4aecfbd93eaf9a7ce8efc2d9bceee0e445e60ca69129c0b5b02","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.19/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.19\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-19:euclid-9-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-19","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-19.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-9-17","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.19","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.19/","sourceLabel":"IX. 17"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-9-19:euclid-7-14:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-19","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-19.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-14","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.19","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.19/","sourceLabel":"VII. 14"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-9-19:euclid-7-21:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-19","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-19.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-21","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.19","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org